# Machine-local override for where vLLM PCIe benchmark logs are written/read.
# Copy this file to .storage-config (gitignored) and uncomment/edit the path below.
# If .storage-config doesn't exist, logs/ (relative to the repo) is used.
#
# Absolute paths only. Precedence: $PCIE_VIZ_LOGS_DIR env var > this file > ./logs
#
# /mnt/example-share/proj/CCG/Shares/cr_arch_lab/Projects/PCIe Visualization/logs
